The real-time departures come from the official API of the Administration des
transports publics (ATP, Ministère de la Mobilité et des Travaux publics,
Luxembourg), the API behind mobiliteit.lu, published on
https://data.public.lu/fr/datasets/api-mobiliteit-lu/ under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Each user needs a personal key
of the ATP. The names and numbers of the stops come from the open GTFS of the
ATP, https://data.public.lu/fr/datasets/horaires-et-arrets-des-transport-publics-gtfs/,
under the same licence. Source: Administration des transports publics /
mobiliteit.lu. The widgets show the source and the time of each reading.

The file test/fixtures/gtfs-stops.txt is an extract of that GTFS (CC BY 4.0).
The other files under test/fixtures were built from the published schema of
the API (rest-2.52.xsd), not recorded from it.

